    },
    [3310003] = {
        id = 3310003,
        text = "3. In the preparation phase, members can challenge 3 weakness instance of the club boss solo 2 times a day. (Chances are shared by 3 instance and reset at 6:00 daily)",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [3310005] = {
        id = 3310005,
        text = "5. In the challenge phase, club members can team-up to challenge club bosses. Club Bosses have 40 levels (Each level is a round). Defeat a boss then the boss of one lever higher will appear. The initial boss level of each cycle is decided by the highest boss level in the last cycle (minus 5 levels)",
