        text = "1. Log in each day at 0:00 to get 5 Valis for free, the item won't be displayed in Bag. \n2. Player can buy 15 Valis at 0:00 each day (tap Unfold button to buy), Diamonds cost will increase gradually. It can also be obtained through Event Supply Station for a period of time. \n3. Regarding rewards, every 10 layers count as 1 round, player can unfold 3 rounds in total. Only the first round is counted into Leaderboard. \n4. Top 1000 Covenanters with best Unfold Progress will enter the Leaderboard. Ranking changes based on Unfold Progress, if players are tied in layers and cards unfolded, whoever achieved it first will be ranked higher. Only Top 300 are displayed. \n5. Leaderboard is finalized at 18:59 of May 16th, from then on it is only for viewing. \n6. Tap Support Ranking to see ranking and preview the rewards. \n7. Leaderboard rewards will be issued around 22:00 of Nov 16th. \n8. Leaderboard updates once every 10 minutes.",
