    [13311355] = {
        id = 13311355,
        text = "1. Welcome to the Display Cabin, where treasures of civilization found in Exploration are stored. \n2. [Star Bonus] shows treasure collection progress. The more treasures you collect and the higher your star level equal higher collection progress. Collection progress provides a stat bonus to the Airship, and increases Spirit stats in ARPG modes!\n3. In [Treasure Star Up] players can craft fragments into Treasures from various civilizations, and boosts Treasure star ratings and ARPG bonuses. \n4. In [Treasure Activation], deploy Treasures to Data Arrays to transmit ARPG bonuses to your Spirits during Tengu City battles!\n4. [Treasure Star Up] costs fragments of the Treasure to be starred up as well as fragments of other Treasures. Tap on the \"+\" icon in the materials UI to open the fragment selection UI. You can mix and match different fragments to reach the fragment requirement.",
